+Unreleased
+==========
+
+- Rename the ``time`` parameter of ``TTLCache.expire()`` and
+  ``TLRUCache.expire()`` to ``now``, so it no longer shadows the
+  ``time`` module.  The ``time`` keyword argument is deprecated, but
+  still accepted for now (no runtime warning is emitted).
+
+
 v7.2.8 (2026-10-31)
 ===================
 
